When I was younger, I was a very energetic kid.
One day, I was on vacation with my parents, my
cousin, and my uncles. When we were at the
airport, my uncle ordered beet juice for my
cousin, and I asked my father for a Coke. When
my father got me the Coke, I started telling my
cousin, “It’s very cold and so good.” Then my
cousin also asked her mother for a Coke, but she
didn’t buy one for her.
